@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
@title Media loading — common viewer gate
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry viewer-source-request
@summary Trace PViewerSourceOpen from command gating and sidecar resolution through preparation of the backend media-load request.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.backend
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag viewer

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer
@alias librarian = Cadroue.Application.LLibrarian
@alias preference = Cadroue.Application.LPreference

[viewer-source-request] Viewer source request <input>
= A direct Source request or scenario-specific tab adapter has called PViewerSourceOpen with a candidate path.
> viewer-gate

[viewer-gate] Viewer source gate <decision>
- Reject requests while viewer commands are inactive or the requested source is blank, and detect whether the source is a Cadroue sidecar @ viewer.PViewerSourceOpen(...)
  @ librarian.LLibrarianFileCheck(...)
? "Blank or inactive" > viewer-stop
? "Sidecar source" > sidecar-resolve
? "Direct media source" > direct-ready

[viewer-stop] Viewer rejects request <output>
= No backend media-load request begins.

[sidecar-resolve] Sidecar source resolution <decision>
- Resolve the recorded source, optionally accept a discovered mismatch, or ask the user to locate and verify the media file @ viewer.PViewerSidecarResolve(...)
  @ viewer.PViewerSidecarFind(...)
? "Media source resolved" > source-join
? "Read failed or source declined" > sidecar-stop

[sidecar-stop] Sidecar resolution ends <output>
= The viewer cannot resolve an accepted media source, so backend loading does not begin.

[direct-ready] Direct source accepted <junction>
> source-join

[source-join] Resolved source convergence <junction>
> remember-source

[remember-source] Last-media preference <storage>
- Store the resolved source as the last-media preference @ preference.LPreferenceMediaSet(...)
> reset-transform

[reset-transform] Incoming transform reset <process>
- Reset rotation and flip to defaults for the incoming source @ viewer.PViewerSourceOpen(...)
> select-engine

[select-engine] Preview engine selection <process>
- Select the configured preview engine before loading the source @ viewer.PViewerEngineSelect(...)
> request-ownership

[request-ownership] Viewer request ownership <process>
- Advance the load serial, stop the viewer clock, clear inactive resume, pause the current player, and abandon preparation if the request became inactive or superseded @ viewer.PPlayerVideoLoad(...)
> expected-path

[expected-path] Expected completion path <storage>
- Store the normalized expected source path used to reject stale completions @ viewer.PPlayerVideoLoad(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.backend
